6<br>https://drive.google.com/file/d/1to4tLI1QDT5Z5vzKUTt2UsnhkLx5-kzN/view<br><br>PROROGATA DALLA 2026/01397<br>https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EoiAuo0yNvu_IwwVL9QRj61HRU6Mu86M/view<br>FINO AL 23/04/2026<br>-------<br>ORDINANZA 2026/00786 <br><br>https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nb1jLQSDtIbD3m2_vuGLEkQpcTbGvNaC/view<br><br>Durata e tempistiche: 23/02/2026 - 23/03/2026]]></description>
